{"id":12,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It collects honey every day. It rubs honey onto the hairs on its legs to carry it back to its nest."},{"games":["Sword","LeafGreen"],"text":"In battle, it flaps its wings at great speed to release highly toxic dust into the air."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Its wings, covered with poisonous powder, repel water. This allows it to fly in the rain."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Nectar from pretty flowers is its favorite food. In fields of flowers, it has heated battles with Cutiefly for territory."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its wings are covered in toxic scales. If it finds bird Pokémon going after Caterpie, Butterfree sprinkles its scales on them to drive them off."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"When attacked by other Pokémon, it defends itself by scattering its poisonous scales and fluttering its wings."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Close examination of its large eyes reveals that each eye is composed of a myriad of tiny eyes."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Butterfree has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can even search out, extract, and carry honey from flowers that are blooming over six miles from its nest."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"The wings are protected by rain-repellent dust. As a result, this Pokémon can fly about even in rain."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Water-repellent powder on its wings enables it to collect honey, even in the heaviest of rains."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can seek, extract, and carry honey from flowers blooming over six miles away."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It flits from flower to flower, collecting honey. It can even identify distant flowers in bloom."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"Its wings, covered with poisonous powders, repel water. This allows it to fly in the rain."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Compound Eyes","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's compound eyes boost its accuracy."},{"name":"Tinted Lens","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon can use “not very effective” moves to deal regular damage."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"forest","color":"White","shape":"Bug wings","evolution":{"id":10,"name":"Caterpie","condition":null,"children":[{"id":11,"name":"Metapod","condition":"Lv. 7","children":[{"id":12,"name":"Butterfree","condition":"Lv. 10","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,16],[1,33],[1,81],[1,106],[1,450],[4,48],[8,93],[12,77],[12,78],[12,79],[16,60],[20,18],[24,403],[28,219],[32,405],[36,366],[40,476],[44,483]],"machine":[512,403,213,226,405,577,527,203,412,263,202,416,542,63,334,676,182,94,240,156,496,219,247,285,214,173,76,164,241,129,168,369,474],"egg":[],"tutor":[814]},"cards":[{"id":"sv9-3","name":"Butterfree","set":"Journey Together","date":"2025-03-28","rarity":"Rare","number":"3","artist":null,"img":"sv9/3"},{"id":"sv3pt5-12","name":"Butterfree","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"12","artist":"Tika Matsuno","img":"sv3pt5/12"},{"id":"swsh8-3","name":"Butterfree","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"3","artist":"ryoma uratsuka","img":"swsh8/3"},{"id":"swsh3-1","name":"Butterfree V","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"1","artist":"Saki Hayashiro","img":"swsh3/1"},{"id":"swsh3-2","name":"Butterfree VMAX","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Rare Holo VMAX","number":"2","artist":"aky CG Works","img":"swsh3/2"},{"id":"swsh3-177","name":"Butterfree V","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rari